      "text": "2. Shri Morarji R. Desai has been sworn in as Prime\nMinister by the Acting President at 3-30 P.M. today,\n24 March, 1977. The Ministry of Home Affairs may kindly\ntake such action as may be considered necessary regarding\nissue of Gazette notifications, etc.",
      "html": null
